        },
        {
          "type": "badge",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "chart",
            "title": "Potency Confirmed",
            "sub": "Myo & D-Chiro Inositol Verified",
            "tip": "<p>HPLC confirms that each batch contains <strong>myo-inositol and D-chiro-inositol at the labeled amounts</strong> — and that the 40:1 ratio is correct in the finished powder, not only in the formula. Because the two are isomers, HPLC separates and measures each one individually.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "badge",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "shield",
            "title": "Heavy Metal Tested",
            "sub": "Arsenic • Cadmium • Mercury • Lead",
            "tip": "<p>Every batch is tested for heavy metals by <strong>ICP-MS</strong> — arsenic, cadmium, mercury, and lead — and must fall within established safety limits before release. ICP-MS detects these metals down to trace levels, well below the limits set for dietary supplements.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "badge",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "microbe",
            "title": "Microbial Safety Tested",
            "sub": "USP <61> & USP <62>",
            "tip": "<p>Every batch is screened for microbial safety: total aerobic count, total yeast and mold, and the absence of specified pathogens — <strong>E. coli, Salmonella, Staphylococcus aureus, and Pseudomonas aeruginosa</strong>. A batch only ships if it meets every limit.</p>"
